{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/642k-Q1z3hYetXcIcWgtqQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:22.842853+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/642k-Q1z3hYetXcIcWgtqQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/4aALnsmSsNhpA8f3MCpQATyPm3KPZaPSJO0sf1LBSJInvOI9fGh6ERh0t7icLCFW1JFpOGWopFpymM6Zp1zxtNqyMkKNzYfzHVv0KUHODqIw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>01</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>在清华物理系建系100周年之际，为增进大学生对清华大学物理系及其相关学科领域的了解，促进大学生互动交流，激发科研兴趣，鼓励有潜质的优秀大学生投身基础物理研究，清华大学物理系将于6月19日-21日举办2026年清华大学物理系“清物百年”本科生科研开放日活动，活动内容主要包括院系基本情况介绍、学科前沿亮点分享、师生互动交流、实验室参观等。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>02</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></p><p><span>2.全国高校本科三年级在校生（2027届毕业生）；</span></p><p><span>3.物理及相关专业，研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></p><p><span>4.本科前5学期总评成绩在年级名列前茅；</span></p><p><span>5.英语水平良好。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>03</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>请在2026年5月9日9:00-5月31日17:00于以下网址进行报名并提交材料：</span></p><p><span>https://openhouse.phys.tsinghua.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>由于名额有限，物理系“清物百年”本科生科研开放日活动组委会将通过电子邮件直接通知申请人入选结果。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>04</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事宜</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>本次开放日活动不收取报名费用。将为入选同学提供活动期间在京的住宿补贴，每人最多500元，凭住宿发票和明细报销（北京市内高校学生除外）。活动期间的餐费、往返路费自理。家庭经济困难的外地同学可以申请往返路费补助。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>05</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>信息查询及联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>关于物理系的更多信息可通过官网查询了解：https://www.phys.tsinghua.edu.cn，其中主要科研方向和老师信息的查询地址为：https://www.phys.tsinghua.edu.cn/yjs1/dsjyjfx.htm</span></p><p><span>咨询邮箱：phys_grad@tsinghua.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>联系电话：010-62785772</span></p><p><span>联  系 人：王老师</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>供稿 | 王晓琬</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 高原</span></p><p><span>审核 | 宋灿立 骆洁</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/4aALnsmSsNhCJZzjhJyBvaib6R9I0PmrvOhZ9K2wRHDAJYmAXSQe9bcXFAbtt2LcexVOM7PxK6opicaxib3p3oIcoXEXm8uYXJ03cyXOwR0mng/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"8d8f05c91989353fe10b8ea579c66c02aae0fb0126e7ad751df1f5306240bf47","textLength":751,"sourceSha256":"9393cacd67d040724f90eca960528343907e809e7dd3ab80463a98e32949d1e5","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-3e7fee3ba5647d790581","title":"2026年清华大学物理系“清物百年”本科生科研开放日活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:22.842853+00:00"}
